cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "fluid-stabilizer: a Physical AI simulation of a 2-axis stabilizer for an open liquid tank"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "yimsemin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yimsemin/fluid-stabilizer"
license: MIT
version: "1.0-archive"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic simulation of an AI-controlled 2-axis gimbal under an open liquid tank on a
  human-driven truck. A rigid (locked) tank beat rule-based, learned and model-predictive control;
  changing the tank (fill ratio, rim height, baffles) reduced spill far more than any controller.
keywords:
  - slosh
  - physical AI
  - reinforcement learning
  - negative results
